      "role": "user",
      "content": "i thought being alone would be better. i thought if i just cut everyone off and stopped trying, the noise would stop and i'd finally be at peace. but now it's just... quiet. too quiet. it feels like i built this massive stone room around myself just to realize i can't breathe in here. i'm just stuck. there's no way out.",
